  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Garantifacilitet om 20 MUSD f&#xf6;r att stimulera utl&#xe5;ning fr&#xe5;n de        palestinska bankerna till f&#xf6;retag och husl&#xe5;n. Under de tre f&#xf6;rsta     &#xe5;ren ska &#xe4;ven tekniskt st&#xf6;d till l&#xe5;ntagarna ges.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Guarantee facility of 20 MUSD to stimualte the local banks to give    loans to SMEs and for housing. During the first three years, there    will also be technical assistance to the borrowers.</narrative>
